{
  "answer": "SALOME and SHEBA are the daughters of the Dean. They plan to secretly attend a Fancy Dress Masked Ball at Durnstone with Major Tarver and Mr. Darbey, officers of the Hussars. Major Tarver is paying attention to Salome, and he arranged for their fancy dresses to be made in London. Later, Major Tarver is in a critical condition because he has incurred Salome's displeasure, and Mr. Darbey explains that unless the Major proposes to the lady in question and is accepted, he must go to the seaside.",
